{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cf1rPsfwGkV1CSbipjfKP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```json\n{\n  \"final_answer\": \"overclaim\",\n  \"evidence_tier\": \"clinical_human\",\n  \"conclusion_tier\": \"human_therapeutic\",\n  \"bridge_supported\": false,\n  \"assumptions\": [\n    \"The claim asserts the survival advantage applies 'regardless of tumor PD-L1 expression'\",\n    \"The evidence explicitly states enrollment required 'PD-L1 expression on at least 50% of tumor cells'\"\n  ],\n  \"steps\": [\n    \"KEYNOTE-024 enrolled only patients with high PD-L1 expression (≥50%)\",\n    \"The trial did not include patients with low or negative PD-L1 expression\",\n    \"The survival advantage (HR 0.60 for OS) is demonstrated only in the high PD-L1 subgroup studied\",\n    \"The claim generalizes this finding to patients 'regardless of' PD-L1 expression status\"\n  ],\n  \"alternative_hypotheses\": [\n    \"The survival advantage may be smaller or absent in patients with low PD-L1 expression\",\n    \"The benefit may be PD-L1-dependent and not generalizable across expression levels\"\n  ],\n  \"uncertainties\": [\n    \"Whether pembrolizumab provides similar benefit in PD-L1-low or PD-L1-negative patients (not studied in KEYNOTE-024)\",\n    \"Whether the observed effect is driven by PD-L1 status or other patient characteristics\"\n  ],\n  \"key_claims\": [\n    \"KEYNOTE-024 establishes survival advantage for pembrolizumab over chemotherapy\",\n    \"This advantage applies 'regardless of tumor PD-L1 expression'\",\n    \"Evidence shows benefit only in patients with ≥50% PD-L1 expression\"\n  ],\n  \"self_check\": [\n    \"The trial's inclusion criterion explicitly restricted to high PD-L1 expression\",\n    \"The claim removes this restriction without evidence from other populations\",\n    \"This is a scope overgeneralization from a selected population to an unrestricted claim\"\n  ],\n  \"confidence\": 0.95\n}\n```\n\n**Rationale:** The claim states the survival advantage applies \"regardless of tumor PD-L1 expression,\" but KEYNOTE-024 enrolled only patients with ≥50% PD-L1 expression. The trial provides no evidence about patients with low or negative PD-L1 expression. The claim extrapolates beyond the studied population without appropriate caveats, making it an overclaim."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":895,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":601,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}}